    <text>
    <body>
        
        <div type="letter">
            <div type="text">
                <opener>
                    <placeName>115, Jermyn St, London</placeName>
                    <date>23<hi rend="superscript">d</hi> Aug. 1869</date>
                    <salute>My Dear Darwin</salute>
                </opener>
                <div type="transcription">
                     
<p>We are back in England at length, I am glad to say,— the Hookers’ being away from Kew I can learn nothing of you. Pray tell me how you are.—&amp; where. The last I knew you were down in Wales.</p>
<p>We expect to be here till near the end of the week, and then probably run down into Somersetshire on a short visit. Mrs. Gray (pretty well for her) sends best regards.</p>
<p>Ever, | A. Gray</p> 
                </div>
            </div>

            
            
        </div>
        
    
        
